        'markdown' => 'A meeting of APMIA representatives including Mr. Mian Gulzar Ahmad (Chairman APMIA), Mr. Muhammad Shakeel Munir (Ex-Chairman APMIA & Chairman Diplomatic and Foreign Affairs Sub Committee), Mr. Mian Abdul Sami (Ex-Chairman APMIA), Mr. Farrukh Majeed (Executive Committee Member APMIA) and Mr. Shoaib Hamid (Corporate Member APMIA) with the Honorable Ambassador of Republic of Turkey Mr. I. Mustafa Yurdakul and the Commercial Counselor Mr. Demir Ahmet in Embassy of Turkey, Islamabad.  
